menu "Launcher: app loader"

    config LX_APP_TEST_BASE_SHIFT_PAGES
        int "Test: shift the app exec mapping by N 64 KB pages"
        range 0 64
        default 0
        help
            Test aid for relocation. Maps N dummy pages before the app's executable
            alias so apps run at a different address than 0x4A000000. Keep 0 in
            normal builds.

    config LX_APP_FAST_MAX_KB
        int "Largest FAST region (internal SRAM) an app may use, KB"
        range 0 512
        default 192
        help
            Code and data an app tags PAPP_FAST / PAPP_FAST_DATA / PAPP_FAST_BSS are
            loaded into executable internal SRAM, up to this size. Bigger FAST regions,
            or a launcher without executable SRAM (ESP_SYSTEM_PMP_IDRAM_SPLIT=y), put
            them in PSRAM with the rest of the app (correct, just slower). 0 = never.

endmenu
